        "id": 2903
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-08-14T18:50:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If SQL identity, in any way shape or form, is used, Resource is required, you cannot run non-SQL resource and any form of SQL identity. Non-SQL identity (LDAP as default), is exceedingly rare. No one is plugging their own resource backend.\n\nThe options are: 1) backport dropping FK migrations *or* 2) this fix. There are no other options.",
      "parentUuid": "9f436f4f_988bb01d",
      "revId": "c0477886ff1a4f8cb2bc9e4b0f931f6986457374",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
